// Titan IIIE-Centaur (1977).
// Two UA1205 solids light on the pad and burn alone; the Titan core's LR87s light as
// they burn out, and they drop a few seconds later. Then the LR91 second stage, the
// Centaur D-1T, the Star-37E propulsion module and Voyager 1. Built from plain parts:
// each solid is the `ua1205` assembly (mods/realism/assemblies/boosters.json5) placed
// on the core.
